        "payload": "tree 7748f045b51580a6a712455c455b519979e9752b\nparent 04cf9ecee435198ac12c29cc733ab444f2104627\nauthor lucasdbr05 <lucasgabrieljake@gmail.com> 1788885075 -0300\ncommitter lucasdbr05 <lucasgabrieljake@gmail.com> 1788885075 -0300\n\nkernel: Expose block header Merkle root\n\nIntroduce btck_BlockMerkleRoot as a type-safe wrapper for a block's Merkle root. Adds functions to retrieve the Merkle root from a block header, copy and destroy it, check for equality, and serialize it to bytes.\n",
